{
  "tema": 5240,
  "slug": "dije-dijiste-dijeron",
  "titulo": "Decir in the preterite",
  "subtitulo": "¿Qué te dijo el doctor?",
  "foto": "t06.jpg",
  "regla": "Decir is irregular in the preterite: stem dij- + -e, -iste, -o, -imos, -eron: dije, dijiste, dijo, dijimos, dijeron (no i after the j). Predecir, bendecir, maldecir and contradecir follow it: predijo, bendijo, maldijeron.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Decir** (_to say, to tell_) changes its stem to **dij-** in the preterite."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The endings are **-e, -iste, -o, -imos**, and **-eron** in ellos: after a **j**, the **i** of -ieron disappears."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**No written accents**: **dije**, **dijo**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "decir",
            "predecir"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "dije",
              "predije"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "dijiste",
              "predijiste"
            ],
            [
              "él / ella / usted",
              "dijo",
              "predijo"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "dijimos",
              "predijimos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos / ellas / ustedes",
              "dijeron",
              "predijeron"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "All the verbs built on decir do the same: **bendecir** → **bendijo**, **maldecir** → **maldije**, **contradecir** → **contradijeron**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: the **j** is greedy and eats the **i**: **dijeron**, never dijieron."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "¿Qué te ==dijo== el doctor?",
              "en": "What did the doctor tell you?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Te ==dije== que la marea iba a subir.",
              "en": "I told you the tide was going to come in."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ya les ==dijimos== a todos que la fiesta es el sábado.",
              "en": "We already told everyone the party is on Saturday."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mis papás me ==dijeron== que no.",
              "en": "My parents told me no."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Por qué no me ==dijiste== nada?",
              "en": "Why didn't you tell me anything?"
            },
            {
              "es": "El padre ==bendijo== a los novios.",
              "en": "The priest blessed the bride and groom."
            },
            {
              "es": "La app ==predijo== lluvia, pero salió el sol.",
              "en": "The app predicted rain, but the sun came out."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Maldije== mi suerte cuando se me rompió la tabla.",
              "en": "I cursed my luck when my board broke."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
